{"1491950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BrightSeeker", "steam_appid": 1491950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrightSeeker is an action RPG set in a futuristic fantasy world where people and their mechanical constructs rose up against their gods. Fight your way through hordes of deadly mechanical soldiers as the Seeker — the last descendant of the ancient gods — who lost their only companion to these machines. Take your revenge and find a way to bring your loved one back to life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/c0aba1a78e36eceec8c34956670ea941.webp?t=1755199817\" width=600 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shoot, slash and dash to defeat numerous enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/5d4269008afea9ff1fc89994b9b90cd7.poster.avif?t=1755199817\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/5d4269008afea9ff1fc89994b9b90cd7.webm?t=1755199817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/5d4269008afea9ff1fc89994b9b90cd7.mp4?t=1755199817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Block projectiles with your shield. Time your blocks well and deflect the projectiles back at your enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin